  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Anomaly</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to deal <strong>1d8+1</strong> energy damage to the target and make them become temporarily <em>Dazed</em>.</p><p><strong>Escalation:</strong> On a success, you may <strong>give the GM a Fear</strong>. If you do, increase the damage die to a <strong>d10</strong> and let it scale using your Power Trait. In addition the target is temporarily <em>Stunned</em> instead of <em>Dazed</em>.</p>",
